# than trusting whatever answers on the far side of the cloudflared tunnel.
#
# The Pi's key mirrors node/known_hosts. The three VM keys are added after the
# VMs are first provisioned:
#
#   for ip in 32 33 34; do ssh-keyscan -t ed25519 192.168.1.$ip; done
